<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rancĭdus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		ranceo, rancens, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>stinking</i>, <i>rank</i>, <i>rancid.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cadavera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 1155</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aper,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 2, 89</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>disgusting</i>, <i>loathsome</i>, <i>offensive</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aspectus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					22, 22, 46, § 92</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quid rancidius, quam, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					6, 185</span></i>
			. — <i>Sup.</i> does not
			occur.— <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rancĭdē</span></b> , <i>nauseously</i>, <i>disgustingly</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ficta verba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 18, 11, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">18, 8,
		1</span></i>.</div>
